1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:13,770
Hedge Position opens the opposite position for the client, the same size or less.

2
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:22,850
Set the amount and rate, then Hedge.

3
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:28,590
The client now holds a buy and a sell of the same size.

4
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:32,110
Close with Hedge closes a position against its opposite one.

5
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:42,200
Both close together, at one rate.

6
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:45,200
Both positions are gone.

